# Camilo Martinez Portfolio Product Context

> This file provides product and business context to all AI agents. Update it as your product evolves.

## Overview

Camilo Martinez Portfolio is **AI-driven fitness analytics platform with Next.js frontend and FastAPI backend.**.

**Vision:** Ship reliable AI-assisted workflows with measurable outcomes and strong operational safety

## Target Users

**Primary Audience:** TBD

**User Personas:**
